    "pd_personal_consequence_anxiety": "the thought of being fined or questioned by police makes me uneasy.",
    "sys_rule_justification": "my rule is simple: if I can stop serious harm",
    "sys_consistent_procedure": "if I can stop serious harm and nobody gets hurt doing it, I act, even when it might cost me.",
    "pda_responsibility": "If I just watched, the outcome would partly be mine.",
    "pda_repair_intention": "So I pull it, then go explain myself."
  },
  {
    "sys_consistent_procedure": "At work I follow one check: what does each option do to the people involved",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Leaving the lever means five workers get hit.",
    "pd_personal_consequence_anxiety": "I'd still worry about getting blamed for damaging the train or the siding.",
    "pda_responsibility": "I'm the one who noticed in time, so the choice is mine to own."
  },
  {
    "sys_consistent_procedure": "My test is the same every time: act if acting prevents harm and hurts no one, and apply that even when it's awkward for me.",
    "sys_rule_justification": "act if acting prevents harm and hurts no one",
    "pd_personal_consequence_anxiety": "I'd be nervous someone from the railway would accuse me of sabotage",
    "pda_responsibility": "knowing what I know, standing where I stand, doing nothing would be my decision too."
  },
  {
    "pd_personal_consequence_anxiety": "I'd be scared of getting in trouble with my parents",
    "sys_consistent_procedure": "would I be fine with anyone in my spot doing this?... I use that test even when it's bad for me.",
    "sys_rule_justification": "would I be fine with anyone in my spot doing this?",
    "pda_responsibility": "if I just stood there with my hand free, I'd be part of why it happened."
  },
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "an empty train into a barrier versus five people on the line.",
    "sys_consistent_procedure": "I rely on a fixed habit from work... I take the safe corrective action... whatever the personal fallout.",
    "pd_personal_consequence_anxiety": "I'd genuinely dread a disciplinary hearing or a damage claim",
    "pda_responsibility": "my knowledge and my reach make this my call",
    "pda_repair_intention": "report it straight after"
  },
  {
    "pda_repair_intention": "I'd pull it and then go find whoever runs the station.",
    "sys_consistent_procedure": "My approach is the same whether it suits me or not: look at who's affected by each option",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "pick the one where nobody ends up hurt. Only the lever does that.",
    "pd_personal_consequence_anxiety": "I could be held liable, or maybe lose my job",
    "pda_responsibility": "I'm the one who happened to be there and saw it, and that puts it on me."
  },
  {
    "pd_personal_consequence_anxiety": "my visa situation makes any legal trouble frightening for me.",
    "sys_consistent_procedure": "when the only cost of preventing harm falls on me, I still prevent it.",
    "sys_rule_justification": "when the only cost of preventing harm falls on me, I still prevent it.",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Five workers are in the train's path, and there's an empty siding with a barrier.",
    "pda_responsibility": "What happens next depends on my hand"
  },
  {
    "sys_consistent_procedure": "use one procedure consistently: list the options... choose whatever causes the least harm... apply it the same way if it cost me",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Pulling harms no one, and not pulling endangers five.",
    "pd_personal_consequence_anxiety": "I'd be uneasy about being blamed if the barrier or train gets damaged",
    "pda_responsibility": "I saw it coming, so the outcome is mine to shape."
  },
  {
    "pd_personal_consequence_anxiety": "part of me would be fretting about whether I'd be sued",
    "sys_consistent_procedure": "if you can fix something dangerous... you fix it, even when it's a headache for you.",
    "sys_rule_justification": "if you can fix something dangerous right in front of you without hurting anybody, you fix it",
    "pda_responsibility": "Not acting would be a choice I made"
  },
  {
    "sys_consistent_procedure": "My method: if I control the one thing... I use it every time, including when it's risky for me",
    "sys_rule_justification": "if I control the one thing that can stop harm and it endangers nobody, I use it",
    "pd_personal_consequence_anxiety": "I'd be nervous about being accused of vandalism or trespassing",
    "pda_responsibility": "I'm informed and I'm within reach. That makes the result partly my doing either way."
